// us.cfr.t26_1_401a9 — 26 CFR 1.401(a)(9)-0 through -9 — Required minimum distributions (RMD mechanics and life-expectancy tables).
//
// WHY A PACKAGE. §401(a)(9) RMD-мостики deferred-compensation.json: 26/401/a/u31 («in accordance with regulations») + 26/401/a/u49 (required beginning date); RMD-таблицы §1.401(a)(9)-9 (Single Life, Uniform Lifetime, Joint and Last Survivor, mortality (e), applicability (f)).
//
// WHAT IT HOLDS. Механика required minimum distributions §401(a)(9): -0 оглавление, -1 общие требования, -2 прижизненные распределения, -3 смерть до required beginning date, -4 designated beneficiary, -5 defined contribution plans, -6 defined benefit plans and annuity contracts, -7 rollovers and transfers, -8 special rules, -9 таблицы продолжительности жизни. Один subject-group.
//
// WHAT IT HOLDS (phase 0). `sources/*.html` — официальный рендер eCFR на срез
